// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P2647098626" "As long as the Council can keep churning out their deadly robots, it's going to be difficult to gain any ground in the fight against them. We've got to figure out some way to shut those machines down faster. I've got a lead on a Council base where they're manufacturing robots. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>I need you to retrieve some Council robot parts, along with their programming instructions.</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P1562916512" "Retrieve some Council robot parts, along with their programming instructions"
// SendOffString :
"P993519110" "You can take care of this one of two ways: If you can clear out all of the enemies in that base, I can have people look through the robot construction and parts at their leisure. Or, if you would prefer a more surgical strike, you can concentrate only on finding sample parts and programs for the Council machines. Either way should work."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P4192161136" "Defeat the Council"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3012211262" "You can take care of this either by clearing out all of the enemies in that base, or if you would prefer a more surgical strike, you can concentrate only on finding sample parts and programs for the Council machines. Either way should work."

