// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P3324900499" "I just got word about a major weapons purchase the Council is making today. I want it stopped, but, more importantly, I want to know who their supplier is. If we can find out where they're getting these weapons, we can prevent future sales. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Will you stop the weapons sale and arrest the interested parties?</A> I can give you the coordinates for where the deal should be going down, but stopping it won't be easy."
// AcceptString :
"P1723039997" "Stop the weapons sale and arrest the interested parties"
// SendOffString :
"P2090167236" "Remember, our primary goal is to find out who's supplying the Council with weapons, so you'll need to concentrate on the ones making the deal. They'll probably be hidden deep in the base and well protected, but taking them down is the only way to win this."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2597606620" "Stop weapons sale to Council"

