// Dialog :
"P4292410503" "Countess Crey herself asked me to pass along her personal thanks. She said that Dr. Arkozan was a rogue employee, one she's had grave doubts about for some time. She's grateful to you for stopping the illegal sale of Crey weaponry. <br>Come to think of it, though, doesn't it seem kind of odd that Arkozan got that far with the deal in the first place? Maybe it's just a side effect of having a company the size of Crey industries to watch over, but you'd think that if the countess had doubts about Arkozan, she would have placed a closer watch on him."
// RandomFameString :
"P4072197118" "{HeroName} busted up a big weapons sale earlier. I guess the Council better get used to using slingshots!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL6_Council_Mission3 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P4101960057" "Archon Eric Manetti is a name that still strikes fear into a lot of hearts. The FBI have him on the most wanted list with over thirty murders, kidnappings, and assassinations under his belt, most of them performed in Paragon City. Every hero in the city has been gunning for him since he emerged from hiding and did away with an entire neighborhood on Striga Isle that had 'seen too much.' But it looks like he's come up with a clever way to avoid justice. According to my sources, he's preparing a raid on a Portal Corporation lab right now, intent on accessing an alternate dimension. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Eric Manetti cannot be allowed to flee this dimension.</A> And you only have 2 hours to stop him."
// AcceptString :
"P1653911029" "Prevent Manetti from fleeing to an alternate dimension"
// SendOffString :
"P1551127708" "This one isn't going to be easy, {HeroName}. Capturing Manetti himself is only part of it. Not only do you need to defeat him and his men, you'll also need to shut down any Portal Corporation computers or devices to prevent a portal opening to an alternate dimension. Portal Corporation keeps a tight lock on those portals, and for good reason! Anything might pop out of one!"
// ActiveTaskString :
"P982011452" "Stop Manetti, shut down portal"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2280604345" "Capturing Manetti himself is only part of it. Not only do you need to defeat him and his men, you'll also need to shut down any Portal Corporation computers or devices to prevent a portal opening to an alternate dimension."

