// Dialog :
"P2863445164" "Good work, {HeroName}. Manetti is still in this dimension and safely under lock and key. According to his jailers, he hasn't stopped raving about this alternate world. It seems he managed to locate one in which the Council is in supreme control. I hate to imagine a place like that, {HeroName}. The Council has shown such a disrespect for human life, it must be a terrible world indeed."
// RandomFameString :
"P1727678949" "The news did a big piece about {HeroName} bringing down Archon Manetti!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnFailure 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2348187884" "I know you tried, {HeroName}, but it looks like Archon Manetti made contact with an alternate world, one in which the Council is in firm control. According to the scientists at Portal Corporation, they were able to shut the portal down, but it may be some time before we know who or what might have gotten through. The scientists are doing everything they can to ensure that the portal remains closed from both sides."
// RandomFameString :
"P615479286" "You remember that awful Manetti who did so much damage on Striga Isle? I heard {HeroName} let him escape justice!"

