"P10023667" "This file contains information several Council bases, including one facility where the most powerful and sociopathic of the Council's soldiers are turned into the dreadful War Wolves. While you can figure out what zone it might be in, the lab's exact location is missing. Only the members of another Council base might know the lab's coordinates."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - DefectorLocation 
