"P1866954731" "I won't forget this, {HeroName}. You did a good thing for a man who's ready to turn his life around. With the information {SHORT_NAME}'s provided, we're ready to move on several key Council installations. It looks like this could be a big break in our ongoing struggle against this menace."
// RandomFameString :
"P2114308318" "I heard that {HeroName} helped a kid named {PERSON_NAME} to leave the Council. I wish more of them would come to their senses."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL6_Council_Compound2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - AdvancedRobotics 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P3401522291" "Advanced robot parts"
// DetailString :
"P3564151762" "These robot parts are mostly metal, but there seems to be organic material included as well. A pack of blue fluid glows with a bioluminescent aura and quivers slightly at your touch."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - RobotTakeover 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P4132888940" "Base commander's story"
// DetailString :
"P3430890535" "After being taken into custody, the former Council base commander told you:<br><br>'Warcry robots are already nearly sentient, so when we got some new robots that were supposed to be smarter than any we'd had before, we didn't know what to expect. It was only days before they had begun replicating more of themselves and upgrading our old robots in secret. Now those machines have taken over this base. I have lost my command to a machine! As we speak, a Warcry robot is running my base! Please, {HeroName}, I beg you to arrest me. It's the only way I might escape punishment."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - RobotPlan 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P69033093" "Robot plan"
// DetailString :
"P2933982118" "You found this plan on a computer in the Council base. In cold, logical, detail it lays out the diagram of a chilling plan: The Rogue Robots plan to strike soon, uploading their core programs onto the Internet and then infiltrating as many computers and electronic devices as possible. If they succeed, they might be able to replicate their consciousness across the entire globe, and begin the destruction of humanity. They have already targeted the location they plan to use for the first upload."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P2294477844" "I need you to get over to a local warehouse on the double. I have it on good authority that the Council is producing some sort of advanced robots there. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>I want you to shut down the production of Council robots and retrieve some parts for analysis.</A> We have to be prepared if we're going to face a new threat."
// AcceptString :
"P862878341" "Stop production of Council robots and retrieve some parts for analysis"
// SendOffString :
"P280891328" "The Council's robots were originally developed by Vandal in the 1940's. They weren't called Zenith Mech Men then, since Vandal was working for another organization. Ever since his research came under the Council's control, they've been trying to push things farther. So be careful. You could be going up against just about anything."

