// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2213663649" "Well, it looks like the Council has expressed its gratitude by knocking over a munitions plant upstate. Still, you did a good job cleaning up their mess. With the robots destroyed and their code deleted, we can hope we've put an end to their dreams of supplanting humanity."
// RandomFameString :
"P2066988668" "Did you see that tape, 'When Robots Go Bad?' There's a segment on {HeroName}!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL6_Council_Errand1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P1724852651" "My contacts have been telling me that the Council just brought in a new batch of recruits from training camps down in South America. From what I'm hearing this new batch is all ready to tear into the city. I'd like them to learn that the city can protect itself. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>I'd like you to hit the Council, and hit 'em hard. </A> Teach this new batch just what they're going to be up against."
// AcceptString :
"P1660233133" "Hit the streets and defeat a few Council soldiers"
// SendOffString :
"P2313221303" "It doesn't matter where you fight them as long as you beat them. If you're looking for Council operations, though, I'd recommend Brickstown and Founders' Falls."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2676473982" "Combat Council menace"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3286446787" "I need you to defeat some more Council soldiers to give any new recruits a proper welcome to Paragon City."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - VILLAIN_GROUP 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - LOITER_ATTACK_TEXT 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// LOITER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3919029244" "I doubt your reputation is correct, {HeroName}!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3928297465" "You have defeated enough Council agents."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3092204625" "My contacts tell me that nearly a quarter of those new recruits have deserted after seeing you in action, {HeroName}. I guess they weren't as dumb as I took them for."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL6_Council_Errand2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P1007775251" "The Council has recently made a habit of sending War Wolves to the streets of Brickstown to 'relax.' And by relax, I mean terrorize the local population. That can't be allowed to continue and I'm asking you fight it. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>I would like to see you hit the streets of Brickstown and show the Council that people aren't their play toys.</A>."
// AcceptString :
"P1691858383" "Defeat Council in Brickstown"
// SendOffString :
"P748382725" "They've been sending up a lot of War Wolves into Seven Gates and the Abyss Towers, but whatever you're fighting and wherever you're doing it, the message will get across."
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2808363355" "You need to defeat more Council agents in Brickstown."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - VILLAIN_GROUP 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - LOITER_ATTACK_TEXT 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// LOITER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1849186930" "{HeroName}! I shall relish this battle!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2808442379" "The Council's upper echelons have ordered the troops to curtail their wilder activity, for now. I know it may be kind of frightening to think that those calculating madmen are watching your actions so closely, but it's actually a good thing. Yeah, they're watching you, {HeroName}. They're watching because they're afraid."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL6_Council_Errand3 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P1208543131" "{HeroName}, I need to ask you to help me out by running a bit of a distraction. Some of the other, less powerful heroes I work with are planning a raid against the Council, but I have reason to think that they're being watched by Ascendant agents. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>So I'd like to ask you to give the Council something else to think about.</A> If you could hit their operations in Founders' Falls, that might help to keep their eyes off of the other team long enough for them to accomplish their mission."
// AcceptString :
"P3559210681" "Go to Founders' Falls and battle the Council to distract them"
// SendOffString :
"P2505294892" "With your reputation, it shouldn't be too hard for to make the Council concentrate on you for a while. Just remember that if it's to work you'll need to do your fighting in Founders' Falls. If you're having trouble finding Council troops, you could try Liberty Town and Williams Square, but I'm sure they'll notice you wherever you fight in the zone."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P1909377429" "Combat Council in Founders' Falls"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2856320304" "I need your presence in Founders' Falls right now. I need you to distract the Council."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - VILLAIN_GROUP 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - LOITER_ATTACK_TEXT 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// LOITER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1012041172" "I have {HeroName} targeted!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2015330469" "Your distraction has allowed {ContactName}'s plan to go off just as planned."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2922562252" "Great job distracting the Council, {HeroName}. Those other heroes were able to pull off their raid without a hitch because those Council soldiers were so worried about you."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL6_Council_Mission2.1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// SendOffString :
"P3167635254" "The deal's going down in a deserted neighborhood near Boomtown. I've already called for an emergency force field. What I care about is learning the source of those weapons. You find the lead negotiators, and we'll have the info we need."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P667692090" "Arrest negotiators & their men"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2921122342" "I need to know who's supplying the Council with weapons!"

